{"unit_id":"TNTest__dsh-infinite-canvas#card-zh","repo":"TNTest/dsh-infinite-canvas","commit":"d8c74a9377017f8e8cf89e6803a5d2b60d30453a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-infinite-canvas（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：让 DSH 通过后端 API 管理已保存的 Infinite Canvas 画布。它向 DSH 注册画布、节点、目录和媒体任务工具，并提供设置面板与可选网页 Agent 启动器。主要功能包括列出和新建画布、查询及编辑节点和连线、分组与自动排布，以及提交和同步图像、音频或视频任务。适合在 DSH 中整理画布内容、制作故事板或管理媒体生成。使用前需要 Infinite Canvas 站点地址和有相应权限的用户 API Key；可选 Agent 供网页端助手使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:798-843","canvas-operations.js:66-129"]}
{"unit_id":"TNTest__dsh-infinite-canvas#card-en","repo":"TNTest/dsh-infinite-canvas","commit":"d8c74a9377017f8e8cf89e6803a5d2b60d30453a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-infinite-canvas lets DSH manage saved canvases: create projects, edit nodes and layouts, and manage media tasks. It adds a settings panel and optional web Agent launcher. Requires a canvas site and scoped user API Key.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:798-843","canvas-operations.js:66-129"]}
