{"unit_id":"TNTest__dsh-infinite-canvas#feature-1","repo":"TNTest/dsh-infinite-canvas","commit":"d8c74a9377017f8e8cf89e6803a5d2b60d30453a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-infinite-canvas 的功能「画布节点编辑」：在指定画布中创建和更新文本、图片、音频或视频节点，维护节点之间的连接，也可移动、删除、分组和排布节点。通过节点工具的操作参数触发，写入前需提交最新版本号。","source":"generated","evidence":["canvas-operations.js:17-31","canvas-operations.js:66-129"]}
{"unit_id":"TNTest__dsh-infinite-canvas#feature-2","repo":"TNTest/dsh-infinite-canvas","commit":"d8c74a9377017f8e8cf89e6803a5d2b60d30453a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-infinite-canvas 的功能「媒体任务管理」：为画布媒体节点提交图像、音频或视频任务，随后查询状态并将主要结果地址和媒体元数据同步回节点。通过媒体工具触发，需提供模型、渠道及符合后端接口的请求对象。","source":"generated","evidence":["canvas-operations.js:207-256"]}
{"unit_id":"TNTest__dsh-infinite-canvas#feature-3","repo":"TNTest/dsh-infinite-canvas","commit":"d8c74a9377017f8e8cf89e6803a5d2b60d30453a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-infinite-canvas 的功能「画布项目管理」：列出、创建、重命名或删除已保存画布，并可返回查看链接。通过项目工具选择操作和画布 ID 触发；创建结果会回读确认，修改和删除需使用当前版本信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:811-830","canvas-operations.js:185-195"]}
{"unit_id":"TNTest__dsh-infinite-canvas#feature-4","repo":"TNTest/dsh-infinite-canvas","commit":"d8c74a9377017f8e8cf89e6803a5d2b60d30453a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-infinite-canvas 的功能「目录查询」：读取后端公开模型和渠道选项、已保存工作流、个人或系统技能，也能获取系统技能文件。通过目录工具指定资源类型以及技能文件路径触发，返回对应的后端数据。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:837-839","canvas-operations.js:197-206"]}
{"unit_id":"TNTest__dsh-infinite-canvas#caveat-1","repo":"TNTest/dsh-infinite-canvas","commit":"d8c74a9377017f8e8cf89e6803a5d2b60d30453a","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-infinite-canvas 使用前须知：后端操作需配置用户 API Key，媒体生成可能消耗额度。版本检查无法消除网页与 API 并发编辑冲突（见 canvas-operations.js:149-159）。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:97-117","canvas-operations.js:149-159"]}
